Package: ausrivRdata
Title: Australian Hydrological Geospatial Fabric (Geofabric) Data for ausrivR Package
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Chris Brauer", email = "pygmyperch@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Maintainer: Chris Brauer <pygmyperch@gmail.com>
Description: Provides geospatial data from the Australian Hydrological Geospatial 
    Fabric (Geofabric) for use with the ausrivR package. This package includes data 
    from the Geofabric National version 3.3 product suite, comprising Surface 
    Network, Surface Cartography, Surface Catchments, Hydrology Reporting Catchments, 
    Hydrology Reporting Regions, and Groundwater Cartography.
    The data originally sourced from http://www.bom.gov.au/water/geofabric/, provided as ESRI File Geodatabases (.gdb)
    and licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0).
    For more information, visit: http://www.bom.gov.au/water/geofabric/documentation.shtml
    Here the data has been reformatted and is distributed as a GeoPackage (.gpkg) for easier use within R.
License: CC-BY-4.0
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Depends: 
    R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports:
    sf,
    magrittr,
    stringr
